# Google Maps JavaScript API key. Required only to draw place shapes
# (regions, rivers) on the map; without it the reader falls back to the
# keyless embed for every place. Create one at
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis and restrict it to your
# domain. Remember the /api/places feature also needs this same key.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=